// Script Variable SURVIVOR_INACTIVE :
"P1271784037" "Why are you doing this? We were safe!"
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_INACTIVE :
"P1691523059" "Calvin Scott is mad!"
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_INACTIVE :
"P855172041" "We finally had peace... we FINALLY had peace!"
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_INACTIVE :
"P1442434187" "Maybe you're right..."
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_ACTIVE :
"P3125099022" "{HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_ACTIVE :
"P2122877149" "Get me out of here!"
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_ACTIVE :
"P3226853399" "I don't know if this is right..."
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_ACTIVE :
"P1575977896" "Stop them!"
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_RESCUE :
"P1482232285" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I can't believe all of this..."
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_RESCUE :
"P3059196796" "I can't believe danger came to this place."
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_RESCUE :
"P3397206567" "I thought we were finally safe..."
// Script Variable SURVIVOR_RESCUE :
"P3562562236" "Is there no place where we can rest?"
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE :
"P2874676231" "You're prisoners! Don't you see that?!"
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE :
"P3289131101" "We're going to help make you free."
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE :
"P3529080565" "They're all tricking you!"
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE :
"P180556659" "Can't you see? This is the beginning of something terrible!"
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE :
"P839821364" "You won't get away with this, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE :
"P1726802498" "You won't be the one to keep these people prisoner!"
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE :
"P1331247402" "You're part of the problem, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable UPA_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE :
"P2306899369" "You can't keep this up forever, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable CREY_INACTIVE :
"P1740720821" "When is the pick up scheduled? We have to get out of here."
// Script Variable CREY_INACTIVE :
"P3963232273" "I don't like it, standing around like this. When are the other agents coming?"
// Script Variable CREY_INACTIVE :
"P756552748" "We were tossed in the Zig for being too obvious, and now we're standing around here. Get a move on!"
// Script Variable CREY_INACTIVE :
"P3661552467" "How much has changed since we were put into the Zig?"
// Script Variable CREY_ACTIVE :
"P1551759639" "Take down {HeroName}, we can't go back to the Zig now!"
// Script Variable CREY_ACTIVE :
"P593205432" "I've been itching to take down heroes like you, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable CREY_ACTIVE :
"P1365188891" "I'm not going back to the Zig!"
// Script Variable CREY_ACTIVE :
"P2535760430" "You heroes can't understand the brilliance of Crey!"
// Script Variable COUNCIL_INACTIVE :
"P2827382377" "Stay on your toes. We got the prisoners out, but we can't get sloppy now."
// Script Variable COUNCIL_INACTIVE :
"P3581522443" "Remember the mission, provide back up to the villains."
// Script Variable COUNCIL_INACTIVE :
"P3770968896" "These villains better help us out for all the trouble we went through to spring them."
// Script Variable COUNCIL_INACTIVE :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable COUNCIL_INACTIVE :
"P2698993393" "Calvin Scott? Still don't know about having him along. He does have an interesting army, though."
// Script Variable COUNCIL_ACTIVE :
"P2347576763" "The Center gave you a chance to walk away, {HeroName}. You should've taken it!"
// Script Variable COUNCIL_ACTIVE :
"P360796318" "You can't stop the Center's plans now!"
// Script Variable COUNCIL_ACTIVE :
"P1420247594" "You think you're better than the Center, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable COUNCIL_ACTIVE :
"P41325450" "Brickstown belongs to the Council, it's the first step!"
// Script Variable COUNCIL_ACTIVE :
"P3035055690" "You so-called heroes can't stop us!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE :
"P347412224" "Oh man, I am BACK!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE :
"P4056042643" "Gotta find Dreck and the others. We're gonna tear this place UP!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE :
"P2258184213" "I'm gonna get me some new arms, we gotta have new stuff by now!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE :
"P1648858277" "This town is OURS! Let's tear it DOWN!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE :
"P3641852990" "I've been dying to get me some practice on a good hero!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE :
"P3842376993" "Tear it all down!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P3118300373" "I'm gonna enjoy takin' you apart, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P3650251530" "I remember you beatin' me last time, {HeroName}, it ain't gonna happen again!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P1092428698" "You think you're so tough, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P1633520436" "You can't beat the Freakshow!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P3948091680" "You're gonna wish you stayed home, {Hero.gender=male buddy|girly}!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P2445506061" "Looks like we got ourselves a volunteer hero to be smashed!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P1022826458" "I've killed better heroes than you, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P3308595102" "Lotta guys in prison wanted a piece of you, {HeroName}, looks like I'm the one to take you down!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P1908849772" "Dreck'll promote me if I take down {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P2998277959" "Smash 'em apart!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P1065971910" "We'll make it big if we take down {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable FREAKSHOW_ACTIVE :
"P4207087610" "Throw everything you've got at this hero boys!"
// Script Variable IDF_INACTIVE :
"P3527437745" "Primal Earth is ripe for the taking. We must put in the law of Cole, even if he has fallen."
// Script Variable IDF_INACTIVE :
"P3531705566" "Remember, no killing the naval prisoners. They're soldiers, just like us."
// Script Variable IDF_INACTIVE :
"P1186652478" "We can't let our emotions about Praetoria get in the way. We must move on."
// Script Variable IDF_INACTIVE :
"P2541278903" "Call in the targets, we begin bombing once we evacuate the civilians."
// Script Variable IDF_INACTIVE :
"P1218422843" "They destroyed our city. We destroy theirs. An eye for an eye!"
// Script Variable IDF_INACTIVE :
"P1184030039" "This is how it has to be. They strike at us, we strike at them."
// Script Variable IDF_INACTIVE :
"P1618168492" "We have to destroy Portal Corp. It's the only way to stop this from happening again."
// Script Variable IDF_ACTIVE :
"P3265337370" "{HeroName}! You're part of the problem!"
// Script Variable IDF_ACTIVE :
"P1033656085" "I've got {HeroName} in my sights!"
// Script Variable IDF_ACTIVE :
"P3030272370" "The ship isn't ready yet, take down {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable IDF_ACTIVE :
"P3515372858" "Call in the back up Powers Division!"
// Script Variable IDF_ACTIVE :
"P3916883156" "We'll carry on Cole's legacy, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable IDF_ACTIVE :
"P436733970" "We swore to serve Emperor Cole, even in defeat!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NavalAttack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2628405673" "Attack on Peregrine Island"
// DetailString :
"P1168732780" "You took down all of the super-powered villains in the base and discovered some more plans from the Council.<br><br>It appears that they freed a large number of the IDF from the Zig and helped them commandeer a naval cruiser! The group plans on opening fire on Peregrine Island. What's worse is that they're going to plant evidence to make it seem like it was a plot done by the New Praetorians!<br><br>According to this, their first plan is to establish a front on a beach in Peregrine, then launch an all out assault!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RefugeeIslandAttack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3567748115" "Target: Refugee Island"
// DetailString :
"P876234077" "You overheard one of the IDF generals talking about a plan to attack the island that the First Ward refugees are being held in. You'll have to head there once things are settled here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL6_7_Marchand_Arc_Two_Souvenir 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P3607073749" "Ziggursky Badge"
// tDetailString :
"P1523570145" "You were given an honorary badge for  the Ziggursky prison after rounding up nearly all the prisoners from a major prison break. It reminds you of an experience you call...<br><br><b>A New War</b><br><br>The Center and Calvin Scott broke out every single prisoner within Ziggursky prison. You and the New Praetorians swarmed Brickstown and Founder's Falls to bring in as many of the prisoners as you could.<br><br>You showed the Council that the heroes of Paragon were up to the task, but the Council had an ace up their sleeve. Calvin Scott and his army attacked Refugee Island and kidnapped all of the New Praetorians.<br><br>You willingly gave yourself over to the Council and came face to face with Calvin Scott, who revealed that Marauder had turned traitor and joined the Council. As you predicted, one of the New Praetorians disabled the security systems in the base, forcing Scott and Marauder to retreat.<br><br>You saved the New Praetorians and destroyed the War Walker facility that the Council was hiding.<br><br>With the prisoners back in the Zig, it was time to finish the fight once and for all by taking down the Council and their generals!"

