// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2134909799" "Alright, {HeroName}, here's the situation topside.<br><br>We've got the <color yellow>Freakshow</color> running rampant in a nearby warehouse.<br><br>The <color yellow>Nemesis army</color> punched a hole in the city streets with one of their machines; they're attempting to make an escape route for their soldiers.<br><br>The <color yellow>Hellions</color> have begun burning down an office building with civilians trapped inside.<Br><br>Finally, we've got a band of villains robbing the Brickstown bank with the Council backing them.<br><br>There's a lot to do, but you've got the New Praetorians here to help you out. We don't know these groups as well as you do; we need you to direct what everyone should take care of. We'll leave saving the bank to you."
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P3241668069" "{HeroName}, we need you to decide where to send Pendragon, Aurora, and Grant."
// Answer Text :
"P1961030858" "(Assign Pendragon's role)"
// Answer Text :
"P78600933" "(Assign Aurora's Role)"
// Answer Text :
"P3997807713" "(Assign Grant's Role)"
// Answer Text :
"P210314348" "I'm ready to head off."
// Page NobleSavageRole Text :
"P3101287265" "Pendragon's main skill is his <color yellow>strength</color>, {HeroName}. His armor can allow him to withstand a beating, and his sword can swipe down anyone in his way. However, he is somewhat weak when it comes to enemies who use advanced <color yellow>tactics</color>.<br><br><color orange>You know that the Nemesis army employ a lot of </color><color yellow>tactics</color><color orange> in their fighting. The Freakshow rely on </color><color yellow>brute force.</color><color orange> The office building will be covered in smoke, so you'll need someone who can </color><color yellow>sense where people are</color><color orange> in order to save all the hostages.</color>"
// Page NobleSavageRole SayOutLoudText :
"P3908885904" "Who should Pendragon handle?"
// Answer Text :
"P2959381491" "Pendragon, save those people from the burning building."
// Answer Text :
"P1174445174" "Pendragon, take care of the Freakshow."
// Answer Text :
"P2364991217" "Pendragon, stop the Nemesis army from escaping."
// Answer Text :
"P3399080962" "(Main Page)"
// Page SavageFire Text :
"P174596793" "<color orange>Pendragon leaves to go handle the Hellions.</color>"
// Page SavageFire SayOutLoudText :
"P1425069863" "Alright, Pendragon will save the hostages in the burning building."
// Page SavageFreakshow Text :
"P1450420787" "<color orange>Pendragon leaves to fight the Freakshow.</color>"
// Page SavageFreakshow SayOutLoudText :
"P59299990" "Alright, Pendragon will fight the Freakshow."
// Page SavageNemesis Text :
"P2764308151" "<color orange>Pendragon leaves to fight Nemesis.</color>"
// Page SavageNemesis SayOutLoudText :
"P284971952" "Alright, Pendragon will fight the Nemesis army."
// Page AuroraRole Text :
"P2904110567" "Aurora's main skill is her <color yellow>telepathy</color>. If there's someone that needs to be found, she can do it. She won't fare very well against <color yellow>brute force</color> or direct combat with enemies using <color yellow>tactics</color>.<br><br><color orange>You know that the Nemesis army employ a lot of </color><color yellow>tactics</color><color orange> in their fighting. The Freakshow rely on </color><color yellow>brute force.</color><color orange> The office building will be covered in smoke, so you'll need someone who can </color><color yellow>sense where people are</color><color orange> in order to save all the hostages.</color>"
// Page AuroraRole SayOutLoudText :
"P2807570478" "Who should Aurora go after?"
// Answer Text :
"P245059623" "Aurora, find those people in the burning building."
// Answer Text :
"P1338873676" "Aurora, take care of the Freakshow."
// Answer Text :
"P3762691944" "Aurora, stop the Nemesis army from escaping."
// Page AuroraFire Text :
"P1483636548" "<color orange>Aurora heads off to handle the burning building.</color>"
// Page AuroraFire SayOutLoudText :
"P2551950695" "Alright, Aurora will go save the people in that burning building."
// Page AuroraFreakshow Text :
"P2684997579" "<color orange>Aurora heads off to fight the Freakshow.</color>"
// Page AuroraFreakshow SayOutLoudText :
"P101177310" "Alright, Aurora will fight the Freakshow."
// Page AuroraNemesis Text :
"P2877287941" "<color orange>Aurora heads off to fight the Nemesis army.</color>"
// Page AuroraNemesis SayOutLoudText :
"P2498366899" "Alright, Aurora will fight the Nemesis army."
// Page GrantRole Text :
"P2359718482" "Grant's main skills are his <color yellow>advanced tactics</color>. He doesn't have a large amount of <color yellow>brute force</color>, but his time in the IDF has taught him how to maneuver in a battlefield. <br><br><color orange>You know that the Nemesis army employ a lot of </color><color yellow>tactics</color><color orange> in their fighting. The Freakshow rely on </color><color yellow>brute force.</color><color orange> The office building will be covered in smoke, so you'll need someone who can </color><color yellow>sense where people are</color><color orange> in order to save all the hostages.</color>"
// Page GrantRole SayOutLoudText :
"P3255158378" "Who should Grant go after?"
// Answer Text :
"P3869324342" "Grant, find those people in the burning building."
// Answer Text :
"P2437226960" "Grant, take on the Freakshow."
// Answer Text :
"P3312172444" "Grant, stop the Nemesis army from escaping."
// Page GrantFire Text :
"P2621972778" "<color orange>Grant goes off to handle the burning building.</color>"
// Page GrantFire SayOutLoudText :
"P1309145251" "Alright, Grant will go rescue the people from the burning building."
// Page GrantFreakshow Text :
"P3377377400" "<color orange>Grant goes off to fight the Freakshow.</color>"
// Page GrantFreakshow SayOutLoudText :
"P1619959212" "Alright, Grant will go fight the Freakshow."
// Page GrantNemesis Text :
"P2246751063" "<color orange>Grant goes off to stop the Nemesis army.</color>"
// Page GrantNemesis SayOutLoudText :
"P1567436256" "Alright, Grant will go fight the Nemesis army."
// Page StartMission Text :
"P1985899548" "Good luck, {HeroName}, we're counting on you!"
// Answer Text :
"P2609973096" "Thanks, Marchand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MarchandOutside 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1062891853" "Good work on the bank, {HeroName}. The others have all reported in on the status of their tasks."
// Answer Text :
"P2749915068" "Tell me Pendragon's status."
// Page SavagePassFreakshow Text :
"P3193718548" "Pendragon was able to handle the Freakshow easily. They came at him with brute force, but Pendragon's might defeated them in the end."
// Answer Text :
"P3371281082" "Tell me Aurora's status."
// Page SavageFailFire Text :
"P1094541644" "Pendragon, unfortunately, couldn't find all of the victims in the fire. He was forced to escape from the building due to all the smoke."
// Page SavageFailNemesis Text :
"P2629864019" "Pendragon's abilities were outmatched by the tactics of the Nemesis army. They surprised him with multiple ambushes and eventually he was medi-ported away to safety."
// Page SavageFailNemesis SayOutLoudText :
"P1887536682" "Pendragon's abilities were outmatched by the tactics of the Nemesis army."
// Page AuroraPassFire Text :
"P1814429288" "The Hellions were a mere hiccup for Aurora. As soon as she entered the building, she disabled all of them, then found all of the victims within minutes."
// Answer Text :
"P1394865315" "Tell me Grant's status."
// Page AuroraFailFreakshow Text :
"P967306797" "Aurora tried to control the Freakshow, but their minds were too chaotic for her. It was her first time trying to handle them, and I'm sure now she knows what to do. She was forced to retreat, unfortunately, and those Freakshow escaped."
// Page AuroraFailFreakshow SayOutLoudText :
"P3890521221" "Aurora tried to control the Freakshow, but their minds were too chaotic for her."
// Page AuroraFailNemesis Text :
"P4075630548" "Aurora was able to read the minds of the Nemesis army, but it seems they've trained themselves against mind readers. They were still able to ambush her, and Aurora was forced to retreat, allowing the Nemesis army to escape."
// Page GrantPassNemesis Text :
"P3892580468" "Grant Creston's combat training outmatched those of the Nemesis army; he saw all their attacks from a mile away. All of the members of the army are back in the Zig."
// Page GrantPassNemesis SayOutLoudText :
"P1537302489" "Grant Creston's combat training outmatched those of the Nemesis army. He was able to see the ambushes and tricks they were trying to pull on him."
// Answer Text :
"P379851188" "That's it. Anything else to report?"
// Page GrantFailFreakshow Text :
"P3718692048" "All of Grant Creston's training couldn't overcome the sheer brute force of the Freakshow. He was forced to retreat after being overwhelmed by them."
// Page GrantFailFire Text :
"P2696865014" "Grant was unable to find all of the hostages in the fire in time. I regret to say that only a few were saved..."
// Page EveryonePassed Text :
"P3524628437" "That's it, for now. You did a great job in figuring out the strengths and weaknesses of the team, {HeroName}.<br><br>Your next goal will be to track down a group of villains. We have reports that they fled into a nearby cavern with a group of Council.<br><br>In the meantime, we'll be splitting up the team, but be aware that they may contact you for further support."
// Page EveryonePassed SayOutLoudText :
"P3729632202" "Your next goal will be to track down a group of villains. We have reports that they fled into a nearby cavern with a group of Council."
// Answer Text :
"P4262229902" "Understood."
// Page EveryoneFailed Text :
"P81054637" "That's it, for now. This was a tough one to handle, {HeroName}. In the end, we can recover from this, but we'll have to be more careful in the future if we're going to make a name for the New Praetorians.<br><br>Your next goal will be to track down a group of villains. We have reports that they fled into a nearby cavern with a group of Council.<br><br>In the meantime, we'll be splitting up the team, but be aware that they may contact you for further support."
// Answer Text :
"P2669062253" "Right, what's next?"
// Page SomeMistakesMade Text :
"P1686334169" "That's it, for now. This was a tough one to handle, {HeroName}. Some mistakes were made, but in the end I think we were able to deal a decent blow against the escaped criminals."
// Page FinalPage Text :
"P695246712" "Your next goal will be to track down a group of villains. We have reports that they fled into a nearby cavern with a group of Council.<br><br>In the meantime, we'll be splitting up the team, but be aware that they may contact you for further support."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3170578645" "The streets of Brickstown are in chaos, {HeroName}. We're getting reports of all sorts of criminals on the loose, ranging from your petty Hellion thugs to Crey scientists, all the way up to costumed villains.<br><br>These people think that they can transform the city into <i>their</i> world. The PPD are doing their best, but there's only so much they can do. It's time for the <color yellow>New Praetorians</color> to make a show of force.<br><br>We're going to hit these criminals hard and fast and show them that we stand for <i>order</i> and <i>law</i>!"
// AcceptString :
"P708506314" "We're on it. Tell me where one of the hotspots are."
// SendOffString :
"P3273534950" "We've got word that there's focused activity around the the Brickstown bank.<br><br>Riptide and Alec Parson are working on an issue with some Crey scientists.  The rest of us will meet at our base to form a game plan. We've got a gang of villains robbing the bank, the Freakshow tearing up the place, the Hellions burning down a building full of civilians, and a group of Nemesis soldiers who are making an escape in the middle of the city.<br><br>It's a lot to handle, but we can do it, {HeroName}, with you leading the charge!"
// TaskTitle :
"P4101051925" "<color deepskyblue>A New War</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P41657034" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Culling the Chaos</color>"

