// Script Variable Caption :
"P3177525604" "<t=3 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=3><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor GoldenRod>Wait, {HeroName}, there's reports of a-."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P3637709060" "<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Attention, refugees! This is Calvin Scott, leader of the United People's Army!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>We are here to liberate you from Vanguard's prison. You are walking right back to a tyranny!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>They would set you up, make you feel comfortable, but you are simply prisoners!<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Some of you may be hurt, but this is the pain that comes with having your freedom.<t=8 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>We will begin the evacuation of the island now. Do not get in our way."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P916350456" "<t=7 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=7><scale 1.75><color Black><bgcolor GoldenRod>This is Marchand. We need to talk right away. We've... we've lost everyone."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - ObjectiveTrigger 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
