// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P2695568308" "Council Liason"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1927222243" "What's the status on Refugee Island?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2098419753" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>They won't be able to use it again. Not as long as we keep up the pressure."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2717465661" "I told you already, we had to attack the island. The explosions didn't kill anyone, just gave them a nasty surprise."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P767052768" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>It was too close, we're -lucky- no one was killed."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4291596046" "We have to fulfill Scott's vision, or else this place will become just like Praetoria."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4210845626" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I know. I didn't want it to be true, but seeing the war walls..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P931857585" "Can we trust the Council? Scott says that we can, but I don't know..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P714471801" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>They were the ones who suggested all of this. We're ahead on the war with their help."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3532845389" "I can't believe what I saw. Will it work?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1622506918" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>It does, I saw it in action. We can win the war with more of them."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2665252433" "How did they manage to put another one of those together?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3051066950" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>It seems they had moles in Praetoria working on schematics the entire time."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3880418176" "Where are these generals of the Council? Shouldn't they be here?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P741235403" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Calvin Scott says we're handling this one. The generals are spreading out through Paragon as we speak."

