// 5 Caption :
"P1605278283" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>I knew you'd make the right choice, {HeroName}."
// 5 Caption :
"P2057522480" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Primal Earth is on the road to becoming a tyranny, just like Praetoria."
// 5 Caption :
"P1249569030" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>The attack on the refugee island was done to wake you up."
// 5 Caption :
"P1660707372" "<x=0.2 y=0.3 t=5 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor Black>Only the Council and men like myself can stop this.."
// 8 Actor4 :
"P11750676" "<em no t=8 d=8>You had a chance to walk away, but you just couldn't do it."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P2909703424" "<t=5 d=5>Allow me to introduce a man who knows what has to be done."
// 5 Actor5 :
"P3686185491" "<goto Marauder>"
// 5 Actor5 :
"P648495359" "{HeroName}. You think I'd refuse the offer to get my power back?"
